  "description": "Dravmo is a play structure from the Abstract series in our NexLev range, held up by wavy poles in several colours instead of straight posts. Between the poles there are climbing panels, a bridge and slides, including a tube slide that shows clearly in the top view. Children cross the bridge, pick a climber and come down by whichever slide is free. It takes 25 to 30 children at a time. The product area is 27'4\" x 20'4\" and the safe play area is 33'4\" x 26'4\", which suits a township park or a large school ground. Play here builds problem solving, focus, motor skills and self control. Its pipes, moulded parts, laminates and rope come with our 3-year warranty. Tell us the ages you expect and we will check the fit.",
